  "description": "Stock purchase Down Below!",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>UPDATE 10/20 at 3:00 PM CST DOWN BELOW - </strong><em><strong>STOCK PURCHASE</strong></em></p><p>Happy Monday, hope you had a great weekend and are recharged…think we may need the energy! Last week was rather bad, or stagnant depending on which assets we talk about. Regardless, we didn’t do much. Some of the “buy the dip” crowd may be in some unrealized profits at the moment; the market is corroborating bad habits to newer investors. Buying the dip works a few times…then ultimately fails in the end. So with all this green on the board, should we be buying? </p><p>Ultimately, that is up to you. I do not aim to nail the bottom, but instead have more confidence that a trend is developing, up or down. Last week I had no confidence in either direction. However, today, the VIX has clearly reversed, and the S&amp;P 500 is moving the direction we wanted. Many of you know I built my own tools…</p><ul><li><p>The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Screener</a> which scans 5000+ stocks a day to find the strongest momentum breakouts with institutional volume. </p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">TradingView Indicators</a> that are based off of Minervini rules and trend breakouts. (Handful of other tools to help you in your investing journey)</p></li></ul><p>Right now, we have everything we need to buy, EXCEPT, a clear trend breakout from the S&amp;P 500. Right now, my indicator is flashing “long” and then disappearing…it is flickering. I want to see the market close today with that signal, because as you can see, historically, most often, you will have several days or even months of bullish activity. This is the S&amp;P 500 telling me that the broad market, does in fact want to go up. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!193r!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2Fc523be24-3cab-4bdd-9168-4f21032d3d03%2Fa806c853-fd89-4fb9-833d-aa5644b453cb.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!193r!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2Fc523be24-3cab-4bdd-9168-4f21032d3d03%2Fa806c853-fd89-4fb9-833d-aa5644b453cb.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!193r!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2Fc523be24-3cab-4bdd-9168-4f21032d3d03%2Fa806c853-fd89-4fb9-833d-aa5644b453cb.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!193r!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2Fc523be24-3cab-4bdd-9168-4f21032d3d03%2Fa806c853-fd89-4fb9-833d-aa5644b453cb.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!193r!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2Fc523be24-3cab-4bdd-9168-4f21032d3d03%2Fa806c853-fd89-4fb9-833d-aa5644b453cb.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!193r!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fmedia_upload%2Fcomment%2Fc523be24-3cab-4bdd-9168-4f21032d3d03%2Fa806c853-fd89-4fb9-833d-aa5644b453cb.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"794\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/media_upload/comment/c523be24-3cab-4bdd-9168-4f21032d3d03/a806c853-fd89-4fb9-833d-aa5644b453cb.png